{"id": "48025", "title": "隋炀帝", "author": "王占君", "category": "历史军事", "count": 40, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/48/48025/48025s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/48/48025.htm", "intro": "隋炀帝杨广在世人印象中是个“艳主”“昏君”。而本书在广阔的时空背景上浓墨重彩地塑造了杨广丰满立体的形象。全书激荡着气吞八荒的雄风，也洋溢着锦帐银烛的香艳和弥漫宫帷的血腥。", "base": "files/article/html/48/48025", "chapters": [{"title": "上卷", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章 惊艳斗母宫", "file": "6501356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 煽气独孤后", "file": "6501357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 韬诲晋王府", "file": "6501358.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 豪赌金银窟", "file": "6501359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章 献美尉迟花", "file": "6501360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 太子谋帅印", "file": "6501361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章 藏身琉璃井", "file": "6501362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章 捉奸百尺楼", "file": "6501363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章 红拂逐李靖", "file": "6501364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章 投毒元妇宫", "file": "6501365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章 栽赃太子府", "file": "6501366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章 赐婚齐国公", "file": "6501367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章 东宫禳二圣", "file": "6501368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章 废储武德殿", "file": "6501369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章 私访瘦西湖", "file": "6501370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "中卷", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十六章 纵情鸳鸯浴", "file": "6501373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章 斗气仁寿宫", "file": "6501375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章 激战无定河", "file": "6501376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章 用计舍力集", "file": "6501377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章 狮吼临芳阁", "file": "6501378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章 设谋永安宫", "file": "6501379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章 独孤后殡天", "file": "6501380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章 杨广蒸父妃", "file": "6501381.html", "available":